{
  "zfVersion": "1.0",
  "name": "ZettelFlow tour",
  "description": "Learn ZettelFlow by using it: three one-click entry points — capture an idea, add a source, ask a question — that teach the whole capture → develop → connect loop while producing real notes. Each note explains what just happened and runs the full on-creation knowledge suite (find related, maturity, orphans, next move, claims, questions). Start here. Offline, no AI.",
  "author": "ZettelFlow",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "canvas": {
    "filename": "ZettelFlow tour.canvas",
    "content": "{\"nodes\": [{\"id\": \"tour-0\", \"type\": \"file\", \"file\": \"1 \\u00b7 Capture an idea.md\", \"x\": -560, \"y\": -120, \"width\": 360, \"height\": 260}, {\"id\": \"tour-1\", \"type\": \"file\", \"file\": \"2 \\u00b7 Add a source.md\", \"x\": -160, \"y\": -120, \"width\": 360, \"height\": 260}, {\"id\": \"tour-2\", \"type\": \"file\", \"file\": \"3 \\u00b7 Ask a question.md\", \"x\": 240, \"y\": -120, \"width\": 360, \"height\": 260}], \"edges\": []}"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "filename": "1 · Capture an idea.md",
      "content": "---\nzettelFlowSettings:\n  root: true\n  label: Capture an idea\n  phase: CAPTURE\n  actions:\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour-title\n    hasUI: true\n    key: title\n    zone: context\n    label: Give your idea a title\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: Title\n    placeholder: A short handle…\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour-idea\n    hasUI: true\n    key: idea\n    zone: context\n    label: In one sentence, what's the idea?\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: In one sentence, what's the idea?\n    placeholder: Your thought…\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour-state\n    hasUI: true\n    key: state\n    zone: frontmatter\n    label: How mature is it? (fleeting / developing / permanent)\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: How mature is it?\n    placeholder: fleeting\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour-tags\n    hasUI: true\n    key: tags\n    zone: frontmatter\n    label: Tags (comma-separated)\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: Tags\n    placeholder: idea, tour\n  - type: zettel-id\n    id: zf-tour-id\n    hasUI: false\n    strategy: timestamp\n    key: id\n    writeFrontmatter: true\n    writeFilename: false\n    timestampFormat: YYYYMMDDHHmm\n    relationship: child\n  onCreation:\n  - type: find-related\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-0-find-related\n    hasUI: false\n    key: related\n    zone: frontmatter\n    limit: 10\n  - type: calculate-maturity\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-0-calculate-maturity\n    hasUI: false\n    key: maturity\n    zone: frontmatter\n  - type: detect-orphan\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-0-detect-orphan\n    hasUI: false\n    key: orphan\n    zone: frontmatter\n  - type: suggest-next-move\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-0-suggest-next-move\n    hasUI: false\n    key: nextMoves\n    zone: frontmatter\n  - type: extract-claims\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-0-extract-claims\n    hasUI: false\n    key: claims\n    zone: frontmatter\n  - type: find-unanswered-question\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-0-find-unanswered-question\n    hasUI: false\n    key: unanswered-questions\n    zone: frontmatter\n  targetFolder: ZettelFlow tour\n  childrenHeader: ''\n  optional: false\n---\n\n# {{title}}\n\n> **ZettelFlow tour · 1/3 — capture.** You just made a note with a *canvas wizard*: every field you\n> filled was an **action**. Your idea was captured, a stable **Zettel ID** was stamped, tags applied,\n> and on creation ZettelFlow ran a suite of **knowledge actions** — it found **related** notes, scored\n> this note's **maturity**, flagged it if it's an **orphan**, suggested your **next move**, pulled out\n> any **claims**, and surfaced **open questions**. Open this note's *properties* to see them all.\n\n{{idea}}\n\n---\n*Next: open **Graph → 3D** to watch this note join your knowledge, then try steps 2 and 3.*\n"
    },
    {
      "filename": "2 · Add a source.md",
      "content": "---\nzettelFlowSettings:\n  root: true\n  label: Add a source\n  phase: DEVELOP\n  actions:\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour2-title\n    hasUI: true\n    key: title\n    zone: context\n    label: Title of the sourced note\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: Title\n    placeholder: What are you noting…\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour2-source\n    hasUI: true\n    key: source\n    zone: frontmatter\n    label: The source ([[wikilink]], URL, DOI or citation)\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: Source\n    placeholder: https://… or [[Author 2020]]\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour2-summary\n    hasUI: true\n    key: summary\n    zone: context\n    label: Summarise it in your own words\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: Summary\n    placeholder: In your own words…\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour2-state\n    hasUI: false\n    key: state\n    zone: frontmatter\n    staticBehaviour: true\n    staticValue: literature\n  onCreation:\n  - type: extract-claims\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-1-extract-claims\n    hasUI: false\n    key: claims\n    zone: frontmatter\n  - type: find-related\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-1-find-related\n    hasUI: false\n    key: related\n    zone: frontmatter\n    limit: 10\n  - type: calculate-maturity\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-1-calculate-maturity\n    hasUI: false\n    key: maturity\n    zone: frontmatter\n  - type: suggest-link\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-1-suggest-link\n    hasUI: false\n    key: suggestedLinks\n    zone: frontmatter\n    limit: 10\n  targetFolder: ZettelFlow tour\n  childrenHeader: ''\n  optional: false\n---\n\n# {{title}}\n\n> **ZettelFlow tour · 2/3 — develop with a source.** A note becomes knowledge when it's **sourced**.\n> The source you gave is stored as a property, so ZettelFlow's model treats this as a *literature note*;\n> on creation it **extracts claims**, finds **related** notes and scores **maturity**. Sourced notes\n> stop being orphans and start anchoring your arguments.\n\n**Source:** {{source}}\n\n{{summary}}\n"
    },
    {
      "filename": "3 · Ask a question.md",
      "content": "---\nzettelFlowSettings:\n  root: true\n  label: Ask a question\n  phase: DEVELOP\n  actions:\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour3-title\n    hasUI: true\n    key: title\n    zone: context\n    label: A short title for the question\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: Title\n    placeholder: The open question…\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour3-question\n    hasUI: true\n    key: question\n    zone: frontmatter\n    label: What do you want to find out?\n    staticBehaviour: false\n    description: What do you want to find out?\n    placeholder: Why / how / what if…\n  - type: prompt\n    id: zf-tour3-state\n    hasUI: false\n    key: state\n    zone: frontmatter\n    staticBehaviour: true\n    staticValue: fleeting\n  onCreation:\n  - type: find-unanswered-question\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-2-find-unanswered-question\n    hasUI: false\n    key: unanswered-questions\n    zone: frontmatter\n  - type: find-related\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-2-find-related\n    hasUI: false\n    key: related\n    zone: frontmatter\n    limit: 10\n  - type: calculate-maturity\n    id: zf-zettelflow-tour-2-calculate-maturity\n    hasUI: false\n    key: maturity\n    zone: frontmatter\n  targetFolder: ZettelFlow tour\n  childrenHeader: ''\n  optional: false\n---\n\n# {{title}}\n\n> **ZettelFlow tour · 3/3 — ask a question.** Open questions drive a slip-box forward. This note is a\n> first-class **question**: on creation ZettelFlow looks for **unanswered questions** and **related**\n> notes so you can see what might answer it. Come back and link an answer when you find one — that's\n> how knowledge *transforms*.\n\n**Question:** {{question}}\n"
    }
  ]
}